B.buo=new A.o8("Is it really free?","Yes, the free plan lets you create your store, list up to 20 products, and receive orders at no cost. If your business grows, paid plans come with a 3-month free trial.")
B.bur=new A.o8("Do I need technical skills?","No. Madio Express is designed so anyone can create and manage their online store without programming or web design knowledge.")
B.bun=new A.o8("How do I receive payments from my customers?","We integrate payment gateways like MercadoPago so your customers can pay with cards, transfers, and other methods. The money goes directly to your account.")
B.buu=new A.o8("Can I use Madio Express in my physical store?","Yes, we include an integrated Point of Sale (POS) that automatically syncs your inventory and sales between your physical and online store.")
B.buw=new A.o8("What if I need help?","You can contact us via WhatsApp or social media. Our team is available to help you with any questions or issues.")
